//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_classifier_stage0: operation classifier の smoke API
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - current registry、shape derivation、trusted source membership、shape mismatch、missing shape、type argument unsupported を小さい入力で確認します。
//:
